# sgrep ignore file — gitignore-style patterns (one per line).
# Matched files are skipped before chunking. Loaded from the scan root AND the
# current directory, so this file (in your working dir) acts as a global ignore.
#
# Note: common build/vendor dirs (node_modules, dist, build, .next, target,
# generated, __generated__, coverage, .venv, …) are ALREADY skipped by default,
# and minified/generated files (very long lines) are auto-detected and skipped.
# Add anything extra below.

*.min.js
*.min.css
*.bundle.js
*.map
*.generated.*
*.pb.go
*_pb2.py
